  "subtitle": "British custard tart with blackberry and apple filling",
  "excerpt": "A blackberry and apple custard tart sets a vanilla custard in a blind-baked pastry case over a layer of softened spiced apple and whole blackberries. The fruit is pre-cooked briefly so it doesn't release excess liquid into the custard as it bakes. The blackberries sink into the set custard as it cooks, creating deep purple pockets through the pale vanilla filling.",
