        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Blackberry and apple custard tart layers a pre-cooked apple and blackberry base under a vanilla custard that bakes at a low temperature. The fruit needs to be pre-cooked until just softened and most of the liquid has reduced; otherwise the custard above it becomes watery. The blackberries create vivid purple swirls through the pale custard."
